I have made some custom graphical tiles for Nethack.  There's lots of
great tiles out there already, but my set is a little different.  The
monsters and creatures are all still represented with
letters/punctuation, although I've dressed them up as nicely as I
could with lighting effects and other stuff like flames or wreaths of
electric sparks, for example.  All other items, weapons, armor, items,
potions, etc. are represented by small iconic pictures, and are easily
differentiated.  Even the scrolls are distingished by little runes. 
My basic plan was to make tiles that looked really nice and were fun
to look at, but were also functional and easy to 'read'.

There are two versions:  one tile set is compatible with the latest
version of Nethack (3.4.2); the tiles are 32x32.  The other tile set
is for use with the latest version of Slashem (0.0.7e3); these tiles
are 24x24.

If anyone is interested in trying out these tile sets, you can
download them here:

www.multifoliate.com/nh/index.html

I would appreciate any input or feedback for future editions of these
tiles, so please let me know what you think!

